<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#meme_juxtaposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A comedic or ironic technique in memes that involves placing two contrasting or incongruous elements together to create humor or commentary. In this case, the juxtaposition of a child in military attire with the context of a nativity play is used to create a humorous commentary on social norms or perceived inappropriateness."@en .
