<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#audience_id_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme targets parents who have experienced or are aware of social or cultural tensions around children's participation in religious events like nativity plays, particularly when the child's attire or behavior is perceived as inappropriate or non-conforming. The text 'my son' and the context of exclusion from a nativity play directly address this demographic, who may relate to the humorous or ironic commentary on social norms surrounding religious inclusivity."@en .
