<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#boy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A young boy, likely between 8-12 years old, smiling at the camera. He has light skin, light-colored eyes, and is wearing a military-style camouflage uniform and vest. His teeth are visible and appear to be braces. He is holding his hand near his neck, and has a toy grenade attached to his vest. His expression is cheerful and confident."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#child_in_military_attire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A young boy dressed in camouflage uniform and vest, with a toy grenade attached to his vest, smiling at the camera in an outdoor setting with fallen leaves."@en .
