<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#religious_exclusion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept of being excluded from or not invited to participate in a religious event or community activity. The text implies that the boy's attire may have been the reason for his exclusion from the nativity play, highlighting a potential social or cultural tension between secular or military imagery and religious settings."@en .
