<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'my son' explicitly projects the user (the parent/meme creator) onto the visual entity 'boy', identifying him as their child. This creates a direct personal connection, making the user feel as if they are the one who experienced the exclusion from the nativity play. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'boy', who is the subject of the textual narrative."@en .
