<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'my son' explicitly refers to the visual entity 'boy'. The meme uses this mapping to create an ironic contrast: the boy, dressed in military attire (a symbol of aggression or non-religiousness), is presented as the subject of the exclusion from a nativity play (a religious event). The mapping links the textual reference 'my son' to the visual depiction of the boy, establishing him as the central subject of the narrative conveyed by the text."@en .
