<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01245#toy_grenade> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A replica or imitation of a real grenade, often used as a prop in military-themed toys or costumes. Its presence in the image, combined with the military attire, reinforces the militaristic theme and contributes to the meme's ironic juxtaposition with the nativity play context."@en .
